Z||000020||sluppy123||02-08-2001||11:33 PM||||Fiero64- I'm glad you like the carpet job. It's made with two pieces left and right split down the middle, and glued down with spray on glue. I used automotive carpeting from the parts store. It takes some trial and error to get it to fit right, plus lot's of time.<BR>||||reg||1
